ODOO018 Context overridden using dict. Better using kwargs `with_context(**ctx)` or `with_context(key=value)`
 --> ODOO018.py:2:1
  |
1 | ctx = {"key": "value"}
2 | self.with_context(ctx)
  | ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
3 | self.with_context(key="value")
4 | self.with_context(**ctx)
  |
